{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415511","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415511","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041551101:1":{"text":"嗯哼哼——哼哼——这个调子不错吧？","source_cn":"嗯哼哼——哼哼——这个调子不错吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CFDB238F7690936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041551102:1":{"text":"很不错！非常欢快的旋律！但总感觉不够热血沸腾啊。","source_cn":"很不错！非常欢快的旋律！但总感觉不够热血沸腾啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD937183B3A14D83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041551103:1":{"text":"毕竟春焰比武的时候那么吵闹，登场音乐必须要更有存在感才行。","source_cn":"毕竟春焰比武的时候那么吵闹，登场音乐必须要更有存在感才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3190E5EDED059CF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041551104:1":{"text":"有道理……那不如这样，这个地方加入鼓和你的铃铛！","source_cn":"有道理……那不如这样，这个地方加入鼓和你的铃铛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59F7F1B5A18A4E63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041551105:1":{"text":"哒啦啦！砰！哒！这样就很有感觉了！","source_cn":"哒啦啦！砰！哒！这样就很有感觉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A93AA08DCD8AEE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041551106:1":{"text":"太棒了！这里还能加快点速度——我已经充满激情了！","source_cn":"太棒了！这里还能加快点速度——我已经充满激情了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76ACDCC2D05A3CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041551107:1":{"text":"我也是，光是想象一下这个调子，就忍不住要跳起舞来！","source_cn":"我也是，光是想象一下这个调子，就忍不住要跳起舞来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE96AC7648CCB0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041551108:1":{"text":"那么，在比武结束后，我们一起去跳舞吧！在烟花下面！","source_cn":"那么，在比武结束后，我们一起去跳舞吧！在烟花下面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8233937AB0219733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041551109:1":{"text":"太妙了！这样的话，烟花的声音也能成为节拍！砰——哒哒哒！","source_cn":"太妙了！这样的话，烟花的声音也能成为节拍！砰——哒哒哒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA00FB7D67167751B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"萨忒娜","source":"萨忒娜","status":"source"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"曼卡拉","source":"曼卡拉","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}